  "releaseNotes": "Alpha release (0.3.0) - Core features working, GPU renderer incomplete.\n\n\t\t\tWORKING:\n\t\t\t- Legacy rendering (sprites, primitives, text)\n\t\t\t- Input system (keyboard, mouse, gamepad)\n\t\t\t- Audio system (sound effects, music)\n\t\t\t- Animation system\n\t\t\t- Collision detection\n\t\t\t- Tilemap support (Tiled .tmj format)\n\t\t\t- UI framework\n\t\t\t- Camera system with zoom/rotation\n\t\t\t- Scene management\n\n\t\t\tNOT YET READY:\n\t\t\t- GPU renderer (use LegacyRenderer backend)\n\t\t\t- Entity Component System (planned for 0.4.0)\n\t\t\t- Scene graph (planned for 0.5.0)\n\n\t\t\tThis is an ALPHA release - expect breaking changes before 1.0.",
